<h3 nodeId="fb1510b942984d9bb8dcc51dabb06b6d">Step2:设置回溯</h3>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="71ca75a7c89944869107e01cba58a109">
<tr nodeId="64c9433fcd834a74b60aa1637973c4f4">
<th colwidth="[374]" nodeId="0d80906916af48b487572c5b11bf2cd9">
<p nodeId="5d5fd8447e3a4548b2505f5aed7b279d"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[964]" nodeId="2f8bb9d6cc64418ea0bf983772b9e4b7">
<p nodeId="ddb4f1c093ca4bcbb057cac38ebf9e2c"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9c67b6777fb74454858ecee334de5640">
<td colwidth="[374]" nodeId="ac6f66fa9e0c4866bb1611e7a4389a14">
<p nodeId="340c6b843abc4813a38cb3c4e194687a"><span font-size="14">【入口】</span></p>
<p nodeId="cc6821b864b8423381e6ea6968797f6a"><span font-size="14">点击进入状态为“未测试”的累计因子详情中--&gt;添加有通过的测试用例后--&gt;点击 开始回溯</span></p>
<p nodeId="3dddb25b19fd4774bda09a6583abe73e"><span font-size="14">⚠️</span></p>
<p nodeId="65607c7b001541b789bee05931bda9f6"><span font-size="14">1.累计因子是未测试的状态（实际上已经测试成功了，此状态方可进行回溯）</span></p>
<p nodeId="de4ea789b00c497d893056dfab879b3f"><span font-size="14">2.累计因子在回溯任务完成前是无法在规则中使用的</span></p>
<p nodeId="f4956a4e93854bdd81ee61bd62167919"><span font-size="14">【大象提示】</span></p>
<p nodeId="d1bbf84276e245c1bc214eb6a52a5a69"><span font-size="14">回溯任务完成后，会收到大象的回溯任务完成信息，详情如下：</span></p>
<p nodeId="a5f447ceaed84fdea4f6f1e9b8ab96fb"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460185524?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="346" height="64" nodeId="d21f1887111a4898ad528e70f849c07c" /></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[964]" nodeId="8dd36fd273e64736a7434135923e817a">
<p nodeId="4c9373602d8c40ed8f691e88efdf8f80"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460335161?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="936" height="202" nodeId="29cf9e5c96434b6b980a43f67b2459bf" /></p>
<p nodeId="df06e13adba145849a3e42ba78334c02"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460335155?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="936" height="494" nodeId="508dcaabb46d4197af5d8d7fae36ae46" /></p>
<p nodeId="b1ecdb698d2849febf532dd03d99ad25"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/248297914?contentType=1" name="image.png" width="395" height="126" nodeId="ce7c1fa8051149d193589b232b1936cf" /><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/248425926?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="483" height="124" nodeId="513686af388149f1a38122ba979100e2" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="d64ed03c95c7431d8bfe3371ba60cb3e">
<td colwidth="[374]" nodeId="4bd96d0a864c477f95b58c46840c0170">
<p nodeId="5429fe471e834fb285148e8ed7d00374"><span font-size="14">【查看回溯任务详情】</span></p>
<p nodeId="338b1d58bbb64c04a9ad9f1a52d30189"><span font-size="14">点击进入 规则回溯 页面，可以在回溯任务列表中查看到刚刚创建的累计因子回溯任务</span></p>
<p nodeId="49f90dabc50146daa3f4545a7b289a79"><span font-size="14">点击进入回溯任务详情中后可以查看回溯任务详情以及回溯结果（发送累计请求量、满足写入条件命中量）</span></p>
<p nodeId="d3670cd56905430bb898a771cf253b53" />
<p nodeId="9e7036542acd4cceaeb546a69476ffd0" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[964]" nodeId="34a76ef34d4e454881d1be80934920fa">
<p nodeId="1fa91e8a73044cd9b7f754de7f5de53d"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460370099?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="823" height="373" nodeId="1d3e0271b1a54acdac9f7495ec16998e" /></p>
