<p nodeId="96f735e3269640d09dd5734e9f10c453"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460185570?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="816" height="386" nodeId="2f857275078b4d46978e6d8edc63dc91" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9412ce73de044c2dba2506e2c4b6286f">
<td colwidth="[374]" nodeId="8926898102bd41a6b1c68ee9e7bda452">
<p nodeId="fbbc896dd6d74b3cb13c3c49b18c1966"><span font-size="14">【终止回溯】</span></p>
<p nodeId="e9d12f3d457d4866adef44f96b9797dd"><span font-size="14">累计因子在回溯过程中，若时间过长或用户需要终止回溯：</span></p>
<p nodeId="4568e48078ac4fa28ab7403d31ac73f6"><span font-size="14">1.可以在累计因子详情页点击“停止回溯”，填写 终止回溯原因 提交后即可终止回溯任务</span></p>
<p nodeId="0003ae8b03344249995c1a652583f639"><span font-size="14">2.或者在规则回溯页面找到回溯任务，点击任务列表中的 终止 按钮，点击弹框中的确认终止按钮后也可终止回溯任务</span></p>
<p nodeId="88eb23b70e554e7980d9fc799b8c4129" />
<p nodeId="3c9e4cc8a8cd494d980b46d0626917be"><span font-size="14">⚠️</span><span color=" "><span font-size="14"><strong>回溯任务未完成前进行终止，任务终止后已经回溯的数据将不会保留</strong></span></span></p>
<p nodeId="313e40707a0441caa07a60c2402f10e5"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">终止后，再次启动回溯不会引入脏数据</span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[964]" nodeId="bd44747601ce47d59be6cfacc0a6a2f8">
<p nodeId="1ba16ae0e1724d4fb0cbeeb246c13c56"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460139849?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="890" height="448" nodeId="4d7387db8ddc40619de6f512ae484d29" /></p>
<p nodeId="2f1ce0d5b7e14f3cad2978dbe11547b2" />
<p nodeId="2ca2d6242aaa48de823a4d432d06715b"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460336942?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="936" height="572" nodeId="da4a4b66a73b41e09eab4d2cee775f42" /></p>
<p nodeId="24e04a5df6fe46c094f31790b40ec086" />
