<p nodeId="d9d8c69ab0bf46b580dc3b1a2e751497" />
<p nodeId="7364f59c465649408bf6250c51fcc098"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/248390725/460375334?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.png" width="776" height="193" nodeId="92eb21fa8ed8474992170482c5fc0431" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9cc65aabc3334bd4ba441605cf5bbe40">
<td colwidth="[374]" nodeId="3862cb0765ee4070b27a4e5fd62f2417">
<p nodeId="30a96414d32f44879a77563b9aaac627"><span font-size="14">【设置上线】</span></p>
<p nodeId="1d7b4d0105ae4b008a671755e3dec9ef"><span font-size="14">回溯完成后，查看回溯结果没有问题后，点进去刚刚创建的累计因子详情页，点击 设置上线</span></p>
<p nodeId="2a1028f4a91f43569a0ef8739bbe5502"><span font-size="14">回到累计因子列表页，刚刚创建的累计因子状态变为  就绪 状态，此时才可在规则中引用</span></p>
